BDK LED engine — source provenance and distribution status

This development package contains copied LED algorithms and configuration,
plus app-side portable integration code. SOURCE_PROVENANCE.json identifies
the copied files and records their exact hashes.

Applicable copyright and redistribution terms for the copied source and
the integration code have not yet been established for distribution.
This notice grants no additional rights and does not assign an open-source
license to any of those files. Source provenance is not a license grant.

Publisher confirmation and the applicable original terms remain required
release inputs. See docs/validation/branding-license-audit.md in the app
repository for the audited evidence and unresolved distribution inputs.
